WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.960
Haneoka Girls' Academy

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.420
What's the plan for after school?

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:13.040
We don't have practice today...
I feel like going somewhere fun!

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:14.790
I'm headed to the bookstore.

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:15.750
Bookstore?

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:16.830
For manga?

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:19.750
The newest volume of "Snappy-chan"
goes on sale today!

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:21.670
Is the story any good...?

00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:24.790
The legendary Super Snappy goes-

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:26.000
No spoilers!

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.750
Ran hasn't had a chance to read it yet.

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:28.830
I don't mind...

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:30.750
Tsugu, you don't have a
Student Council meeting, do you?

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:31.580
Nope!

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:34.420
After the bookstore, how about we try
the new parfait at the café?

00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:36.210
Hooray, parfait!

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:38.000
Did you go to "Over the Future"?

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:38.880
Sure did!

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:41.130
I got choked up when Minato-senpai started talking.

00:00:41.130 --> 00:00:43.540
Same. Talk about emotional!

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:45.670
No wonder we love Roselia!

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:50.210
Oh, my mom's calling me.

00:00:50.580 --> 00:00:51.710
Hello?

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:54.670
What?! The old shopkeepers?!

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:58.290
Suzuki's Famous

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:58.290
Alley Shop

00:00:58.290 --> 00:01:02.040
Reserved for the Jizo-dori Shopping Center

00:00:58.290 --> 00:01:02.040
Vacationers Association

00:00:58.630 --> 00:01:01.920
I've been looking forward to this vacation.

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:04.420
Time to get on the bus!

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:06.380
Heave-ho!

00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:12.500
They threw their backs out?!

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:14.960
What?! Non-cancellable reservations?!

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:16.540
Fine with me!

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:16.540
Hanasakigawa Girls' Academy

00:01:16.540 --> 00:01:19.210
I can invite a bunch of friends, right?

00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:20.920
Sure thing, Mom.

00:01:20.920 --> 00:01:22.330
We'll be right over.

00:01:24.170 --> 00:01:26.170
What's wrong, Saaya?

00:01:26.750 --> 00:01:30.460
She said she needs us to take
a trip to the hot springs...

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:32.080
Hot springs?

00:01:35.960 --> 00:01:40.830
Initial honki no jibun yuzurenakute

00:01:40.830 --> 00:01:45.670
Shoudou yubisaki kara emotion!

00:01:55.540 --> 00:02:00.290
Ano hi watashi wa shoujo demo otona demo naku

00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:05.250
Majirike no nai manazashi de yume dake miteta

00:02:05.580 --> 00:02:10.290
Meramera yurayurari moetagiru yoru

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:15.330
Yuuki o kamishimete tabi ni detanda

00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:20.670
Initial hajimete wakiagatta mono wa

00:02:20.670 --> 00:02:25.460
Furue karadajuu kara emotion

00:02:25.460 --> 00:02:30.380
Naze ni hatenaki yozora ni mukatte

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:36.250
Nandomo onnaji kotoba o sakebitsuzukeru no ka?

00:02:36.830 --> 00:02:40.130
Toki ni aimai de miushinau

00:02:40.130 --> 00:02:42.960
Tomadoigachi na jibun demo

00:02:42.960 --> 00:02:47.380
"Te ni shita mono" wa imademo koko ni

00:02:47.580 --> 00:02:50.040
Initial no sono saki e

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:52.460
Hoshi no kodou kanjite

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:57.130
(Kimi wa) tsuyoku kakinarashiteiru

00:02:57.130 --> 00:03:00.130
(Ima mo) kokoro furuwasete

00:03:00.130 --> 00:03:02.000
Aishiteiru!

00:03:03.420 --> 00:03:05.830
Hot springs are the best!

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:07.250
I can't wait!

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:13.460
Should We Be Lounging Around Right Now?

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:16.380
It's a real sea of school uniforms out here.

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:19.000
Seriously...? We're seriously going...?

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:20.920
MASKING'S uniform...

00:03:20.920 --> 00:03:22.290
Like towels and stuff. They got all that there?
MASKING'S uniform...

00:03:22.290 --> 00:03:22.960
Like towels and stuff. They got all that there?
Isn't that a mega-elite school for rich people?!

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:24.210
It seems so.
Isn't that a mega-elite school for rich people?!

00:03:24.210 --> 00:03:24.670
Isn't that a mega-elite school for rich people?!

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:28.460
This way, LAYER-san!
Over here, LAYER-san!

00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:29.170
Over here, LAYER-san!

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:32.880
Yo.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:34.630
Thank goodness...

00:03:34.630 --> 00:03:36.290
Hey, Rei. You made it.

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:38.040
I ran most of the way here.

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:39.500
Did you go home and change?

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:41.880
No, my school doesn't make us wear uniforms.

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:43.830
Wow, that must be nice!

00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:46.540
Are you sure it's alright if I tag along?

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:48.630
Of course! You're doing us a huge favor!

00:03:49.210 --> 00:03:50.630
Where's Asuka-chan?

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:52.880
I invited her to come...

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:56.420
Atchan said she can't skip out
on studying for her mock exams.

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:57.880
What about Chisato-senpai and the others?

00:03:57.880 --> 00:03:59.540
She said they're too busy filming.

00:03:59.540 --> 00:04:01.500
Michelle hasn't shown up yet.

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:02.710
You're right!

00:04:02.710 --> 00:04:05.500
Uh, she said she'd meet up with us at the hotel.

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:06.750
Works for me!

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:07.830
Sounds good!

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:10.750
Oh? My little kittens are joining me on this journey...

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:11.630
Kittens?

00:04:11.630 --> 00:04:15.630
We get to visit the hot springs with Kaoru-senpai...?!

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:17.630
In the words of Shakespeare:

00:04:17.630 --> 00:04:18.630
How fleeting...

00:04:20.830 --> 00:04:22.670
"Twelfth Night," eh?

00:04:22.670 --> 00:04:24.580
Hey LOCK, where are the others?

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:27.420
About that... I got in touch with them earlier...

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:31.040
If I hurry, I can be there in three and a half hours.

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:32.540
Three and a half hours?!

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:33.880
Why so far?!

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:36.330
Don't feel obligated, PAREO-san!

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:37.790
We can hang out some other time.

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:39.210
I'm sorry...

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:43.080
Let's see...

00:04:44.710 --> 00:04:46.540
CHU2-san, there's a hot spring-

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:48.000
No, thank you!

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:51.750
Why would I go out of my way
to do something stupid like taking a bath?!

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:57.960
...is what she said.

00:04:58.130 --> 00:05:00.920
That girl seriously hates taking baths, doesn't she?

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:02.500
I think she prefers showers.

00:05:02.500 --> 00:05:04.130
Let's bring her back a souvenir.

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:05.040
Good idea.

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:06.250
Attention, please!

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:08.880
Can I get a head count?

00:05:08.880 --> 00:05:11.080
The Afterglow girls are here!

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:13.250
All members of Roselia, present!

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:14.830
Hello Happy's here.

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:15.670
PoPiPa, too!

00:05:15.670 --> 00:05:17.250
Three members of RAS.

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:19.330
Are you ready to party?!

00:05:19.330 --> 00:05:21.420
Yeah!

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:23.420
Ready, and...!

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:25.330
Welcome to Pastel * Palettes'...

00:05:25.330 --> 00:05:27.330
...Curiosity Corner!

00:05:26.500 --> 00:05:29.960
Curiosity Corner

00:05:29.960 --> 00:05:34.960
Today, we're highlighting the hot springs at this
vintage inn with its unique, shingle-person bathtubs!

00:05:29.960 --> 00:05:34.960
Good News for Those Prone to the Cold

00:05:29.960 --> 00:05:34.960
A must for stiff shoulders!

00:05:29.960 --> 00:05:34.960
Relax in single-person tubs and meditate beneath fountains

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:36.380
Whoopsie!

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:40.130
These hot springs feature 24 single-person bathtubs.

00:05:40.130 --> 00:05:43.130
When the place is packed, it's a glorious sight to see!

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:46.080
Containing an extraordinarily high
concentration of calcium,

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:50.830
these waters alleviate circulation issues,
stiff shoulders, muscle soreness, and joint pain...

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:55.330
Y-you're kidding me...

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:57.790
E..Eve-chan...?

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:00.460
How cute!

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:03.830
The proprietress of the inn helped me put it on!

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:06.540
Yukata are the best part of hot springs,
don't you think?

00:06:08.710 --> 00:06:10.460
R-right!

00:06:10.830 --> 00:06:12.920
And we invite you to enjoy yourselves, too.

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:15.540
Pastel * Palettes, signing off!

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:23.170
Welcome

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:23.170
Jizo-dori Shopping Center Vacationers Association

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:23.170
Pastel * Palettes

00:06:20.460 --> 00:06:22.040
It's PasuPare!

00:06:23.290 --> 00:06:25.170
So we're staying at the same hotel, after all.

00:06:25.170 --> 00:06:27.170
Let's hurry on inside.

00:06:30.420 --> 00:06:34.330
PoPiPa, Hello Happy, and RAS
are in the main building!

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:36.080
Big Sis!

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:36.750
Time to go look for Michelle!

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:38.330
Big Sis?
Time to go look for Michelle!

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:41.540
Yippee! I wanna take a dip
in the hot springs with Michelle!

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:42.960
Sounds like a case of murder...
Listen, about Michelle...

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:43.380
Did you say murder?!
Listen, about Michelle...

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:44.330
Did you say murder?!

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:45.750
Big Sis!

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:47.960
Says here we're in the south building.

00:06:47.960 --> 00:06:49.710
Roselia's also in the south building, right?

00:06:49.710 --> 00:06:50.460
Big Sis!
Yup!

00:06:50.460 --> 00:06:51.000
Big Sis!
Let's get going.

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:51.830
Right.

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:53.210
Big Sis!

00:06:53.210 --> 00:06:54.210
Hina?

00:06:54.210 --> 00:06:56.960
Let's take a dip in the hot springs together
after I'm done with work!

00:06:56.960 --> 00:06:57.630
Huh?

00:06:57.630 --> 00:06:59.920
So THIS is where you ran off to, Hina-san.

00:07:00.880 --> 00:07:04.630
Hina-chan, you have to wait until we finish
confirming the schedule for our morning shoot.

00:07:04.630 --> 00:07:06.540
Aww...

00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:09.830
POPPY

00:07:10.710 --> 00:07:13.420
I guess this our room...

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:17.540
The "Poppy Room"...

00:07:21.630 --> 00:07:23.330
Look how pretty!

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:25.420
It is, isn't it?

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:27.630
It's chock full of hot springs!

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:29.880
We shouldn't even be here in the first place...

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:31.330
You're STILL stuck on that?

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:33.380
They've got a giant bathhouse with wooden tubs!

00:07:33.380 --> 00:07:37.460
Single-person tubs, fountains, footbaths,
and even open-air baths!

00:07:37.460 --> 00:07:39.790
Hear that, Arisa-chan? Open-air baths!

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:40.750
Yeah, yeah.

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:42.500
You'd better not let this opportunity go to waste.

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:44.080
I might check out the fountains.

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:46.170
The footbaths sound nice to me.

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:49.630
W-well, if you insist...

00:07:49.630 --> 00:07:52.130
I suppose I could go for a quick dip...

00:07:53.460 --> 00:07:55.920
Warming up our shoulders would help us play better.

00:07:55.920 --> 00:07:57.540
Let's invite Rock and the others to go with us!

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:59.130
I bet they're in the Waterlily Room.

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:59.130
Note: "Suiren" (waterlily) is a homonym for the type of bamboo curtain

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:59.130
after which RAISE A SUILEN is named.

00:07:59.130 --> 00:08:01.420
W-wait for me! I need to unpack!

00:08:01.420 --> 00:08:04.380
Arisa, the brochure says they've got
towels in the bathhouse.

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:06.500
But my fluffy towel is the only one I like using!

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:08.540
We're leaving you behind, Arisa!

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:13.750
POPPY

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:10.130
C'mon, wait a sec!
We're leaving you behind, Arisa!

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:11.580
No need to rush.

00:08:11.580 --> 00:08:13.210
Take your time!

00:08:21.540 --> 00:08:22.670
Imai-san.

00:08:22.670 --> 00:08:25.420
LAYER-san! What's up? You by yourself?

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:26.380
Yeah.

00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:28.290
LOCK went with Hana-chan and the others.

00:08:28.290 --> 00:08:29.790
Masuki's checking out the arcade games.

00:08:30.580 --> 00:08:32.040
I'm in the same boat.

00:08:32.040 --> 00:08:34.170
Specialty Bathtubs

00:08:36.170 --> 00:08:38.670
ROSE

00:08:38.670 --> 00:08:46.290
It says here that guests who manage to solve
this crossword puzzle will be awarded a special prize!

00:08:38.670 --> 00:08:39.670
Crossword Puzzle

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:48.380
I think I'll give it a try.

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:50.040
Let me read the clues to you!

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:50.880
'Kay.

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:55.040
Dun-dun! Clue #1: A sweet and dark type of liquid.

00:08:58.170 --> 00:08:59.290
Rorsia!

00:08:59.830 --> 00:09:01.790
I was feeling kind of awkward...

00:09:01.790 --> 00:09:02.920
How come?

00:09:02.920 --> 00:09:07.080
I'm not very used to
hanging around people my own age.

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:08.630
Really?

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:12.540
I've never been on a fieldtrip or anything like that.

00:09:12.540 --> 00:09:14.330
And I changed schools a couple times.

00:09:14.330 --> 00:09:16.040
My entire life has revolved around music...

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:19.130
In that case, how about a pillow fight?
Everyone can join in!

00:09:19.130 --> 00:09:20.790
Including you, Imai-san?

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:21.880
Of course!

00:09:21.880 --> 00:09:24.460
Call me "Lisa," by the way.
No need to be formal.

00:09:25.420 --> 00:09:27.540
But I'm... a second-year.

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:29.500
What?! You're younger than me?!

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:32.460
You seemed so mature that I just assumed
we were the same age.

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:34.290
I get that a lot...

00:09:35.540 --> 00:09:38.920
Not in a bad way!
It's because you're cool and laidback...

00:09:38.920 --> 00:09:42.250
Those big jerks always end up leaving me behind...

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:45.000
Rei Wakana?!

00:09:46.380 --> 00:09:48.170
Aren't you the girl with the gold stars?

00:09:48.170 --> 00:09:50.380
Wha-?! Why would you bring that up?!

00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:51.920
Gold stars?

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:55.790
At my music school, they hand out
gold star stickers for exceptional performance.

00:09:56.170 --> 00:09:59.000
She got more stars than anyone else.
How could I forget?

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:00.750
Cut it out!

00:10:00.750 --> 00:10:02.210
Nice job, Arisa!

00:10:02.210 --> 00:10:06.000
N-no, I... You see... I was, uh...

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:09.880
Out of everyone in our grade,
you were the most talented.

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:10.920
H-hold on!

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:13.670
I even remember the song you played at our recital.

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:18.250
PLEASE STOP!

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:22.380
Come to think of it, bears have
their own problems to worry about.

00:10:22.710 --> 00:10:25.040
My shoulders are stiff as a board.

00:10:25.040 --> 00:10:28.040
I've always thought Michelle's head looked heavy.

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:30.290
Being a bear must be rough...

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:32.460
Arisa?

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:35.380
That was a close one...

00:10:36.040 --> 00:10:37.710
Huh? Where's everyone else?

00:10:37.710 --> 00:10:40.420
Rimi ran off to look for Kaoru-san.

00:10:40.420 --> 00:10:42.580
Saaya-senpai's enjoying the wooden bathtubs.

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:44.380
O-Tae went to the fountains!

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:57.710
We managed to achieve
positive results at "Over the Future,"

00:10:57.710 --> 00:11:00.330
but should we really be
lounging around right now?

00:11:01.130 --> 00:11:02.540
All the more reason.

00:11:09.460 --> 00:11:10.630
Steady...

00:11:10.630 --> 00:11:12.710
Carefully to the right. Right...

00:11:13.130 --> 00:11:17.210
Karaoke

00:11:17.380 --> 00:11:19.460
I must've gotten lost again...

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:22.460
To the right... Right!

00:11:22.460 --> 00:11:24.630
Excuse me, where's the south building...?

00:11:24.630 --> 00:11:25.750
Go right! Right!

00:11:25.750 --> 00:11:26.960
To the right...

00:11:26.960 --> 00:11:28.960
Thank you very much.

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:33.460
Dammit! That's the millionth time!

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:35.210
I need more tokens...

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:38.420
Wha-? Hey, hold it!

00:11:38.750 --> 00:11:40.170
I said, "Go right."

00:11:41.250 --> 00:11:42.420
Come with me.

00:11:52.830 --> 00:11:55.750
Sayo? Didn't you say you were
going back to the room?

00:11:58.380 --> 00:11:59.710
Mitake-san...

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:06.920
I watched a livestream of the
"Over the Future" concert.

00:12:07.710 --> 00:12:09.290
Not half bad.

00:12:09.710 --> 00:12:10.750
I see.

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:13.880
You're going to the "BanG Dream"
tournament finals, aren't you?

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:15.330
That's the goal.

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:18.580
Why did Afterglow choose not to participate?

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:22.630
To us, the Budokan is special. It's a dream of ours.

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:25.500
The glue that holds the five of us together.

00:12:27.670 --> 00:12:29.750
So, we discussed the situation.

00:12:29.750 --> 00:12:34.500
The Jizo Festival came along first, and we decided
to commit ourselves to the performance.

00:12:34.750 --> 00:12:35.920
I see.

00:12:35.920 --> 00:12:37.130
Indeed.

00:12:35.920 --> 00:12:39.790
HAPPY

00:12:37.130 --> 00:12:39.790
For if there were such a thing as destiny...

00:12:39.790 --> 00:12:42.250
Why, it would be exactly as I have said!

00:12:42.250 --> 00:12:43.250
Milord!

00:12:43.250 --> 00:12:45.380
How enchanting...!

00:12:45.380 --> 00:12:46.540
We're back!

00:12:46.670 --> 00:12:48.790
Welcome back, your majesties.

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:51.460
Blessed by the presence of royalty!

00:12:51.460 --> 00:12:53.250
Have you seen Michelle around?

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:55.210
We think she might be lost.

00:12:56.080 --> 00:12:57.920
Do not fret, dearest Kokoro!

00:12:57.920 --> 00:13:01.750
Shall I accompany you
in your quest to recover Michelle?

00:13:03.040 --> 00:13:04.290
I'll go, too!

00:13:04.290 --> 00:13:05.830
M-me, too!

00:13:05.830 --> 00:13:09.330
Good idea. If we search together,
I'm sure we'll find her!

00:13:09.330 --> 00:13:12.080
Let us depart on a journey filled with steam!

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:13.330
Happy!

00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:14.580
Lucky!

00:13:14.880 --> 00:13:15.830
Smile.

00:13:16.170 --> 00:13:17.790
Yay!

00:13:17.790 --> 00:13:19.920
Bushido!

00:13:17.790 --> 00:13:20.960
HAPPY

00:13:23.750 --> 00:13:25.630
Kanon's running late...

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:27.580
Do you think she got lost?

00:13:27.580 --> 00:13:29.880
Perhaps we should've picked her up, after all.

00:13:29.880 --> 00:13:31.460
You've got a point...

00:13:31.460 --> 00:13:32.920
Oh, there she is!

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:35.580
Thank goodness!

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:37.250
That girl seems familiar...

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:41.880
King?!

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:45.460
She's coming over here!

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:47.580
I'm sorry for making you wait.

00:13:47.580 --> 00:13:49.080
We just got here a minute ago.

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:50.670
Did you make it alright?

00:13:50.670 --> 00:13:53.000
Yeah, MASKING showed me the way.

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:54.250
Thanks.

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:56.420
Pastel * Palettes...

00:13:58.130 --> 00:14:00.380
Maya Yamato-san...

00:14:02.630 --> 00:14:04.580
I'm a huge fan!

00:14:05.670 --> 00:14:07.630
My name is Masuki Sato.

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:09.750
I-I know who you are!

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:13.420
Your skills as a drummer have been an inspiration
to me since BEFORE you became famous!

00:14:13.420 --> 00:14:14.330
What?!

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:16.380
You're so talented that you became a celebrity.

00:14:16.380 --> 00:14:19.170
Do you have any idea
how insanely awesome that is?!

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:21.460
Maya-san, you're my idol!

00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:26.540
I've never been happier!

00:14:26.540 --> 00:14:27.580
What's the matter?

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:28.580
Tomoe-chan.

00:14:28.580 --> 00:14:30.580
Tomoe! You forgot your key.

00:14:31.170 --> 00:14:32.540
My bad, Saaya!

00:14:32.960 --> 00:14:34.040
Big Sis!

00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:35.330
Hey, Ako!

00:14:36.170 --> 00:14:37.290
Wait a minute...!

00:14:37.290 --> 00:14:38.130
Maya-san?

00:14:38.460 --> 00:14:42.170
I've got it! How about a rap session
between us drummers?

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:44.170
Rap session?

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:45.040
Assembly Hall RYUGU

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:45.580
It's been a while since we've
hung out together like this.

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:47.420
GARDEN

00:14:45.580 --> 00:14:47.420
Is it good?
It's been a while since we've
hung out together like this.

00:14:47.420 --> 00:14:48.790
You're right!

00:14:49.750 --> 00:14:52.830
Dark and bubbly, the perfect flavor!

00:14:52.830 --> 00:14:55.330
Tomoe-chan, would you like any orange juice?

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:56.380
Sure.

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:58.080
Thank you very much.

00:14:58.080 --> 00:14:59.290
Yay!

00:15:00.880 --> 00:15:02.630
Here you go, Kanon-senpai.

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:03.920
Thanks!

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:05.000
What about you, Saaya-chan?

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:07.080
I think I'll have apple juice.

00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:09.170
Let's see... Where did I...?

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:11.960
Here, Maya-san! 120% apple juice.

00:15:11.960 --> 00:15:14.750
Wow, thanks a bunch. That's plenty for me.

00:15:14.750 --> 00:15:16.330
Go ahead, down the hatch!

00:15:21.170 --> 00:15:22.460
Like I was saying...

00:15:22.460 --> 00:15:25.330
I believe in putting forth my utmost effort
for the sake of the band!

00:15:25.330 --> 00:15:28.960
In an ideal world, the concept of dedication
would become synonymous with Pastel * Palettes.

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:30.710
That's my hope, anyway!

00:15:32.080 --> 00:15:33.420
Makes perfect sense.

00:15:33.420 --> 00:15:35.130
They sure are riled up.

00:15:35.130 --> 00:15:37.250
And all it took was some juice!

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:40.170
That's 'cause my bandmates are hopelessly stubborn.

00:15:40.170 --> 00:15:43.170
Who knows where they'd be
without me to back 'em up?

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:44.540
You sure are cool!

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:46.290
Hello Happy's cool too, you know.

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:47.330
Kaoru-san?

00:15:47.330 --> 00:15:48.380
All of you.

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:51.580
Without a care in the world,
you manage to stay true to yourselves.

00:15:51.960 --> 00:15:55.210
You're always performing at
kindergartens and hospitals, right?

00:15:55.210 --> 00:15:56.130
Yeah.

00:15:56.130 --> 00:15:59.670
My goal is to make the world smile
with my friends at my side.

00:15:59.670 --> 00:16:03.250
People like to talk big,
but actions speak louder than words.

00:16:03.250 --> 00:16:05.080
That's how I KNOW you guys are cool.

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:06.040
Yup!

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:08.170
I'm glad you feel that way.

00:16:08.170 --> 00:16:11.420
I tend to get anxious around strangers...

00:16:11.420 --> 00:16:14.330
I used to live in a small and lonely world.

00:16:14.500 --> 00:16:18.960
But then, Kokoro-chan taught me
the power of a smile,

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:21.290
and my world suddenly grew larger.

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:23.170
For Misaki-chan...

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:25.080
...and Hagumi-chan...

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:27.210
...and Kaoru-san...

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:29.920
It's probably the same for all of us.

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:32.210
The joy of performing together,

00:16:32.210 --> 00:16:35.080
and the satisfaction of seeing
the people around us smile.

00:16:35.630 --> 00:16:37.830
Kokoro-chan was the one who showed us that.

00:16:38.630 --> 00:16:44.040
I'm almost positive I wouldn't be able to do these things
if I hadn't met my Hello Happy bandmates.

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:46.750
And for that, I'm grateful.

00:16:47.330 --> 00:16:49.080
Your bandmates, eh?

00:16:51.170 --> 00:16:52.790
With RAS...

00:16:54.750 --> 00:16:58.000
I'm pretty sure we share the same goals, but...

00:16:58.580 --> 00:17:00.040
Masuki-san...

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:04.130
Do you care about your bandmates, Masuki-san?

00:17:04.130 --> 00:17:05.130
'Course!

00:17:05.130 --> 00:17:07.210
Then there's no need to worry!

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:09.540
We've been through a rough patch or two, ourselves.

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:13.250
But to be honest, we've weathered plenty of storms
because we had each other to rely on!

00:17:15.040 --> 00:17:16.130
Same here.

00:17:17.040 --> 00:17:20.750
In some ways, I used to keep
the people around me at arm's length.

00:17:20.750 --> 00:17:23.920
But now, I'm confident when it comes to
expressing my feelings.

00:17:23.920 --> 00:17:26.630
And if you ask me, I owe it all to my bandmates.

00:17:28.170 --> 00:17:29.630
I know exactly what you mean!

00:17:29.630 --> 00:17:30.830
Absolutely right.

00:17:30.830 --> 00:17:31.830
Yeah!

00:17:37.460 --> 00:17:39.420
WATERLILY

00:17:39.540 --> 00:17:40.710
It's open.

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:43.040
Sorry for barging in!

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:44.170
Toyama-san?

00:17:44.170 --> 00:17:45.880
Rock overheated in the bath...

00:17:45.880 --> 00:17:46.750
What?!

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:50.630
Don't worry.
She's taking a nap in our room right now.

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:53.210
The hotel staff were nice enough
to give her an ice pack.

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:55.330
Thank goodness...

00:17:56.630 --> 00:17:59.290
RAS' show the other day was amazing!

00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:00.960
It practically gave me chills!

00:18:00.960 --> 00:18:02.080
Thanks.

00:18:02.080 --> 00:18:05.750
During our performance, I feel like I was
able to draw out some sort of...

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:07.790
intensity in my voice.

00:18:07.790 --> 00:18:08.670
Yup!

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:14.920
You, and Rock, and Masuki-san,
and PAREO-chan, and CHU2-chan!

00:18:15.210 --> 00:18:18.040
You were all SUPER awesome!

00:18:20.170 --> 00:18:22.210
I'm not causing problems, am I?

00:18:22.210 --> 00:18:23.040
Huh?

00:18:23.380 --> 00:18:27.750
I... don't want to cause
any more problems for PoPiPa.

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:30.880
Rei-san.

00:18:31.880 --> 00:18:33.420
No need to worry!

00:18:35.500 --> 00:18:36.710
You're tough.

00:18:36.710 --> 00:18:38.380
What?! No way!

00:18:38.380 --> 00:18:40.670
I'm always depending on the others for support...

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:42.290
That sounds nice.

00:18:42.710 --> 00:18:44.420
I think you make a great band.

00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:49.130
What exactly IS a band...?

00:18:50.170 --> 00:18:51.580
A band is...

00:18:53.630 --> 00:18:55.210
...sparkly and tingly!

00:18:55.210 --> 00:18:56.080
Huh?

00:18:56.080 --> 00:18:59.170
A band sparkles and makes you feel tingly.

00:18:59.170 --> 00:19:02.210
When you try it out for yourself,
you get this huge thrill!

00:19:02.210 --> 00:19:05.500
And when everyone plays together,
it's like "Woo!" levels of fun!

00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:07.710
There's more to it than that, but...

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:11.130
Thank you.

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:17.580
I'm not entirely sure what you mean
by "sparkly," but I love PoPiPa.

00:19:18.080 --> 00:19:20.580
Even CHU2 was impressed by
your self-sponsored concert.

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:21.580
Seriously?!

00:19:21.580 --> 00:19:22.420
Yeah.

00:19:22.420 --> 00:19:23.710
Thanks a bunch!

00:19:23.960 --> 00:19:25.790
I look forward to seeing you perform again.

00:19:25.790 --> 00:19:27.210
I'll save you a ticket!

00:19:27.210 --> 00:19:28.250
Deal.

00:19:29.210 --> 00:19:31.040
They're becoming friends...

00:19:32.420 --> 00:19:33.460
Hana-chan...?

00:19:33.460 --> 00:19:35.580
Off to the bathhouse again, O-Tae?

00:19:35.960 --> 00:19:39.460
There! Misaki and Michelle's scent
is coming from that direction!

00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:42.080
I bet they're taking a dip
in the hot springs together!

00:19:43.420 --> 00:19:47.000
MOONFLOWER

00:19:44.290 --> 00:19:47.000
It's nice getting to relax and unwind like this.

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:49.250
These manju buns are tasty!

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:50.130
Yeah.

00:19:50.130 --> 00:19:50.960
Whoa!

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:52.130
What's wrong, Tomoe?

00:19:52.130 --> 00:19:53.460
Check this out!

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:55.210
PoPiPa's MV?

00:19:59.580 --> 00:20:02.380
So dizzy...

00:20:08.920 --> 00:20:11.670
It's possible I've been soaking for too long...

00:20:23.170 --> 00:20:26.170
I knew it... I've been soaking for too long.

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:40.330
Wh-what is that thing?

00:20:42.540 --> 00:20:45.500
H-huh? I feel kinda...

00:20:49.330 --> 00:20:51.920
Arisa-san! Are you alright?!

00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:54.130
Arisa-san!

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:57.380
POPPY

00:20:57.750 --> 00:21:00.290
Thanks for carrying her back to our room, Eve.

00:21:00.290 --> 00:21:02.420
My pleasure. Always happy to help!

00:21:02.420 --> 00:21:03.790
Arisa!

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:06.920
I can't believe she was
soaking in the water this whole time...

00:21:06.920 --> 00:21:08.920
Not surprised she overheated.

00:21:09.920 --> 00:21:11.670
PoPiPa! Anyone there?

00:21:11.670 --> 00:21:13.790
We're here! Come on in.

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:15.040
What's up?

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:18.000
Your MV's totally blowing up online!

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:20.170
We couldn't wait to show you!

00:21:24.670 --> 00:21:26.920
Over 10,000 views and counting!

00:21:26.920 --> 00:21:27.750
Yup!

00:21:28.040 --> 00:21:31.420
I never imagined our video
would get this much attention...

00:21:31.710 --> 00:21:33.710
All aboard the Doggie Express!

00:21:35.330 --> 00:21:36.380
Arisa!

00:21:36.380 --> 00:21:37.380
Arisa-chan?!

00:21:37.380 --> 00:21:38.580
What happened?!

00:21:38.580 --> 00:21:39.710
She needs water!

00:21:39.710 --> 00:21:42.250
In that case, I shall cast my Water Style Jutsu!

00:21:42.250 --> 00:21:44.250
I'll go get an ice pack!

00:21:42.420 --> 00:21:51.420
Poppin' Party MV (PoPi-V ♥) "Poppin' Shuffle"

00:21:42.420 --> 00:21:51.420
10011 Views

00:21:44.250 --> 00:21:45.670
Arisa!

00:21:45.670 --> 00:21:46.580
H-hold on...!

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:48.380
Rock-chan!

00:21:48.380 --> 00:21:49.630
O-Tae!

00:21:49.630 --> 00:21:51.130
What do we do?!

00:21:56.170 --> 00:22:08.080
Yume uchinuku shunkan ni kimi wa nani o omou no?

00:22:10.210 --> 00:22:12.380
La la la la la la...

00:22:12.540 --> 00:22:14.750
La la la la la la...

00:22:14.960 --> 00:22:17.080
La la la la la la...

00:22:17.080 --> 00:22:19.170
La la la...

00:22:19.170 --> 00:22:23.880
Hashaginagara itsudemo oikaketeta

00:22:23.880 --> 00:22:28.330
Honoka ni hikaru yume no kakera

00:22:28.630 --> 00:22:33.290
Zenbu hiroiatsumete tsunaidemita

00:22:33.290 --> 00:22:38.580
Minna o terasu hoshi ni natta

00:22:38.580 --> 00:22:43.540
Kirameku omoidetachi dakishime

00:22:43.540 --> 00:22:48.420
Fumidasu kimi no senaka itooshii

00:22:48.420 --> 00:22:49.080
Dakara?

00:22:49.080 --> 00:22:53.790
Dare yori mo (kimi to) itsumademo (issho ni)

00:22:53.790 --> 00:22:58.540
Ima kara (minna de) utau yo (sei no de)

00:22:58.540 --> 00:23:02.210
Kore ijou matenai kara?

00:23:02.210 --> 00:23:03.130
"Sei no!"

00:23:03.130 --> 00:23:08.040
Aoi sora ni Yes! BanG! Dream! (Sono yume)

00:23:08.040 --> 00:23:12.880
Kaze ni yureru yuuki no uta (Uchinuke!)

00:23:12.880 --> 00:23:22.130
Yakusoku shita ano basho to kimi o tsunaida melody

00:23:35.420 --> 00:23:37.790
Next Time: Let's Go, PoPiPa
